{"3380490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bloodthorn", "steam_appid": 3380490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/c50712d8c919b551528018e8eff4442e.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were judged unworthy of death. Your crimes were too terrible for the executioner's block, so the court sent you here instead. Castle Bloodthorn was cursed long before you arrived. Whatever waits inside it will decide what remains of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloodthorn</strong> is a first-person dark fantasy dungeon crawler where death is forgiving, but Limbo is not. Survive each floor to keep what you have earned. Fail, and the castle takes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/da13ae2c8007409ac713a63871879a37.poster.avif?t=1785829021\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/da13ae2c8007409ac713a63871879a37.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/da13ae2c8007409ac713a63871879a37.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/32868a0e082d1f8fb0c5b3f390f3683d.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodthorn is a vertical descent through a corrupted gothic nightmare. Every floor was once a wing of the king's stronghold before the curse consumed it. Now the walls remember what they were, and hate what they have become. Push deeper. Earn the key. Climb again.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person melee and ranged combat with stamina-based depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiered loot hidden in chests, destructible containers, and forgotten corners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mid-floor saves. No checkpoints. Every step is committed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/8660c965f555e12439b618f769280108.poster.avif?t=1785829021\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/8660c965f555e12439b618f769280108.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/8660c965f555e12439b618f769280108.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/1700df53f90d08a90a4441f322300001.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die on a floor, and you fall into Limbo, a contained survival challenge that decides everything. Survive it, and you respawn  with your gear intact. Die there, and you lose everything earned on that floor. Forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/6811f1b7d900dc4b7e69e697891f6e93.poster.avif?t=1785829021\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/6811f1b7d900dc4b7e69e697891f6e93.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/6811f1b7d900dc4b7e69e697891f6e93.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no second saves—only second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/db9d89fb75c81003b37690490f800a69.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies you fight are not monsters. They are the king's former servants, twisted by the same curse that took the castle. Every corridor is haunted by what the household became.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor boss was once a figure of the court. Kill them, and you inherit part of what they were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/f621000ba3581ac6bf438bfe577cdcad.poster.avif?t=1785829021\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/f621000ba3581ac6bf438bfe577cdcad.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/f621000ba3581ac6bf438bfe577cdcad.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/733180b9d4216b59bf38585581478314.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss you defeat grants a corruption skill point that permanently reshapes your body and unlocks new abilities. Your character becomes a record of what you have killed. By the time you reach the throne room, you will be as powerful as the demons you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/bcec3767a20280664253a928838c579b.poster.avif?t=1785829021\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/bcec3767a20280664253a928838c579b.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/bcec3767a20280664253a928838c579b.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/e8168612b6f27c94f477884d1e24cbc9.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between every ascent, return to the Cell Hub to prepare for what comes next.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair degraded weapons and armour at the workbench</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new gear and consumables from harvested materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with merchants using accumulated Bloodvials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character across masks, hoods, and armour sets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree progression is tied to permanent character growth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/840c7086a2aebde3172277c5bae13de7.poster.avif?t=1785829021\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/840c7086a2aebde3172277c5bae13de7.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/840c7086a2aebde3172277c5bae13de7.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/2aac4a1fa7b8f34e06ea5435efe5718c.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodvials are your healing supply and your currency, dropped by every enemy you defeat. The economy rewards aggression. The more you kill, the longer you can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/a4c3aa911e677828dcecc742b8149bc3.poster.avif?t=1785829021\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/a4c3aa911e677828dcecc742b8149bc3.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/a4c3aa911e677828dcecc742b8149bc3.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/0e6d2772084df1e25b4da8523ee5d2ff.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person dark fantasy dungeon crawler</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level-based progression with permanent consequences and hidden paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limbo: a second-chance survival system after every death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss corruption that permanently reshapes your body and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hub-based crafting, repair, and equipment customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodvials: a unified healing and currency economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboard for completed runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/b6c3414253638c84cd383ed328f35570.poster.avif?t=1785829021\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/b6c3414253638c84cd383ed328f35570.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/b6c3414253638c84cd383ed328f35570.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/c50712d8c919b551528018e8eff4442e.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were judged unworthy of death. Your crimes were too terrible for the executioner's block, so the court sent you here instead. Castle Bloodthorn was cursed long before you arrived. Whatever waits inside it will decide what remains of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloodthorn</strong> is a first-person dark fantasy dungeon crawler where death is forgiving, but Limbo is not. Survive each floor to keep what you have earned. Fail, and the castle takes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/da13ae2c8007409ac713a63871879a37.poster.avif?t=1785829021\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/da13ae2c8007409ac713a63871879a37.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/da13ae2c8007409ac713a63871879a37.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/32868a0e082d1f8fb0c5b3f390f3683d.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodthorn is a vertical descent through a corrupted gothic nightmare. Every floor was once a wing of the king's stronghold before the curse consumed it. Now the walls remember what they were, and hate what they have become. Push deeper. Earn the key. Climb again.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person melee and ranged combat with stamina-based depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiered loot hidden in chests, destructible containers, and forgotten corners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mid-floor saves. No checkpoints. Every step is committed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/