assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/bcec3767a20280664253a928838c579b.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/bcec3767a20280664253a928838c579b.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/e8168612b6f27c94f477884d1e24cbc9.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between every ascent, return to the Cell Hub to prepare for what comes next.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair degraded weapons and armour at the workbench</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new gear and consumables from harvested materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with merchants using accumulated Bloodvials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character across masks, hoods, and armour sets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree progression is tied to permanent character growth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/840c7086a2aebde3172277c5bae13de7.poster.avif?t=1785829021\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/840c7086a2aebde3172277c5bae13de7.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/840c7086a2aebde3172277c5bae13de7.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/2aac4a1fa7b8f34e06ea5435efe5718c.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodvials are your healing supply and your currency, dropped by every enemy you defeat. The economy rewards aggression. The more you kill, the longer you can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/a4c3aa911e677828dcecc742b8149bc3.poster.avif?t=1785829021\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/a4c3aa911e677828dcecc742b8149bc3.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/a4c3aa911e677828dcecc742b8149bc3.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/0e6d2772084df1e25b4da8523ee5d2ff.avif?t=1785829021\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person dark fantasy dungeon crawler</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level-based progression with permanent consequences and hidden paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limbo: a second-chance survival system after every death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss corruption that permanently reshapes your body and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hub-based crafting, repair, and equipment customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodvials: a unified healing and currency economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboard for completed runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/b6c3414253638c84cd383ed328f35570.poster.avif?t=1785829021\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/b6c3414253638c84cd383ed328f35570.webm?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/extras/b6c3414253638c84cd383ed328f35570.mp4?t=1785829021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A first-person dark fantasy dungeon crawler where death is not the end. Climb a cursed castle floor by floor, craft gear between runs, and manage your loot through a brutal save system. Complete a floor to keep it. Die in Limbo, and lose everything.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/1b0ccaf91566b4ce2535cee771523eb0f44d9e96/header.jpg?t=1785829021", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/4d2891de2f1363f88b7ec0dc8b27653f2ddc808c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785829021", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380490/4d2891de2f1363f88b7ec0dc8b27653f2ddc808c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785829021", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 8th gen or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><str